#~ msgstr "Autonomous six-wheeled compactor with an industrial waste tank and collection arms. The war left its identification faulty: it treats living beings as salvageable material."

#~ msgid "Guardião industrial da eclusa, formado por portas blindadas, pistões e uma lente central de vigilância. Ainda executa a ordem de isolamento dada durante a guerra; na segunda fase, abandona a contenção e ativa força letal."
#~ msgstr "Industrial lock guardian made of armored doors, pistons and a central surveillance lens. It still carries out the isolation order given during the war; in the second phase, it abandons containment and activates lethal force."

